copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. Section 105):

  Title 2 of the Code of Federal Regulations, Part 200 (Uniform Administrative
  Requirements, Cost Principles, and Audit Requirements for Federal Awards),
  including the 2024 revision effective for fiscal years beginning on or after
  2024-10-01.
  https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-2/subtitle-A/chapter-II/part-200

  Standard Form 425, Federal Financial Report, and its instructions, and the
  related Standard Forms 270, 271, 428, and 429, published by the U.S. General
  Services Administration.
  https://www.grants.gov/forms/post-award-reporting-forms

  Agency reporting guidance including the National Institutes of Health Grants
  Policy Statement and the National Science Foundation Proposal and Award
