the terms of a specific Notice of Award govern over any general template.

================================================================================
RELATED WORK CREDITED BY THIS PROGRAM
================================================================================

grantdesk does not vendor code or data from the projects below, but it is part
of a program that builds directly on them, and it links to sibling tools that
do. They are named here because this program is only credible if it is a good
citizen of the nonprofit open data community.

  Nonprofit Open Data Collective
  https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective
  In particular the IRS E-file Master Concordance File, which is what makes
  Form 990 XML tractable across schema versions.

  GivingTuesday 990 data tool repository
  https://990data.givingtuesday.org/tool-repository/
  Including form-990-xml-mapper and form-990-xml-parser.

